  "content": "{section: Verso 1}\n[G]Sorry is the fool who trades his soul for a [C]corvette\n[A7]Thinks he'll get the girl he'll only get the [B7]mechanic\n[E7]What's missing? He's living a day he'll soon [Cm]forget [D]\n[C]That's one more time around. The sun is going [D7]down\n[B7]The moon is out but he's drunk and shouting\n[E7]Putting people down. He's pissing. [C]He's living a day he'll soon [D7]forget [G]\n\n{section: Verso 2}\n[D7]Counts his money every [C]morning\n[D7]The only thing that keeps him [C]horny\n[D7]Locked in a giant house that's [C]alarming\n[Cm]The townsfolk they all [D]laugh\n\n{section: Verso 3}\n[G]Sorry is the fool who trades his love for [C]hi-rise rent\n[A7]Seem the more you make equals the loneliness [B7]you get\n[E7]And it's fitting. He's barely living a day he'll [Cm]soon forget [D]\n\n[C]That's one more time around and there is not a [D7]sound\n[B7]He's lying dead clutching Benjamins. Never put the money [E7]down\n[C]He's stiffening. We're all whistling. [D7]A man we'll soon [G]forget"
